The graph shows a logistic model, with the dashed line as its horizontal asymptote. Which equation could it be?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\begin{axis}[axis lines=middle, xlabel={$t$}, ylabel={$P$}, xmin=-1, xmax=17, ymin=-40, ymax=470, xtick={5,10,15}, ytick={100,400}, samples=120, clip=false, ylabel near ticks]
\addplot[thick, ->, domain=0:16] {400/(1+3*exp(-0.4*x))};
\addplot[dashed, domain=0:17] (x, 400);
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
